{'symbol': 'FLT', 'date': '2022-02-23 09:00:00', 'title': 'CORPAY ANNOUNCES NEW COLLABORATION WITH THE PRODUCERS GUILD OF AMERICA', 'text': "TORONTO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CORPAY1, A FLEETCOR (NYSE: FLT) BRAND THAT PROVIDES INTEGRATED CROSS-BORDER PAYMENTS AND CURRENCY RISK MANAGEMENT SOLUTIONS, IS PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE THEY ARE COLLABORATING WITH THE PRODUCERS GUILD OF AMERICA (PGA), A NON-PROFIT TRADE ORGANIZATION THAT REPRESENTS, PROTECTS AND PROMOTES THE INTERESTS OF ALL MEMBERS OF THE PRODUCING TEAM IN FILM, TELEVISION AND NEW MEDIA, TO PROVIDE PGA MEMBERS WITH ACCESS TO CORPAY'S GLOBAL PAYMENTS AND FOREIGN CURRENCY EXCHANGE SOLUTIONS"}